 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "k1",
   "text": "See that fuel truck?",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "k2",
   "text": "That's its brain,",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "k2b",
   "text": "flashing amber while it thinks.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "k3",
   "text": "And when it calls a tool, out rolls the ground crew!",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "k4",
   "text": "Baggage reads files.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "k5",
   "text": "The tug runs commands.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "k6",
   "text": "And that camera truck films.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "k7",
   "text": "That number shows how hard the computer is working,",
   "gap": 0.35
  },
  {
   "id": "k8",
   "text": "and that tag?",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "k9",
   "text": "That's the bill!",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "k10",
   "text": "An estimate up front,",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "k10b",
   "text": "and the real cost after,",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "k11",
   "text": "so you learn what things really cost.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
   "id": "r1",
   "text": "Now, how does everybody know what's happening?",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "id": "r2",
   "text": "Right beside the tower is the Radio,",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "r2b",
   "text": "our lightweight Haiku helper.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "r3",
   "text": "It watches the whole crew,",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "r3b",
   "text": "and keeps this board up to date,",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "r3c",
   "text": "so the director never has to.",
   "gap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "r4",
   "text": "Up in the tower is the Orchestrator, our director.",
   "gap": 0.3
  },
  {
   "id": "r5",
   "text": "It plans the work,",
   "gap": 0.2
  },
  {
   "id": "r5b",
   "text": "and shoots each order right down the taxi line.",
   "gap": 0.6
  }
 ],
